			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 750040101,
					"content": "咦？這裡怎麼會有一塊石碑…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750040102
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 750040102,
					"content": "大概是以前部族裡的人留下來的吧？很久以前常常會有這樣的東西作為警告的界碑，來告訴你：「你已經越界了！」",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750040103
					],
					"speakerTitle": "蒂圖"
				},
				{
					"id": 750040103,
					"content": "#{F#妳}{M#你}們有時候會在納塔路邊看到一些刻有白色紋路的石頭，也是差不多的作用，只不過那些現在都已經被廢棄了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750040104
					],
					"speakerTitle": "蒂圖"
				},
				{
					"id": 750040104,
					"content": "唔！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750040105
					],
					"speakerTitle": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}"
				},
				{
					"id": 750040105,
					"content": "原來是這樣。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750040106
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 750040106,
					"content": "邊界，在納塔也是很嚴肅的事情…生者與死者、內與外、上與下，只有真正行於界線中的人才能掌握好危險的分寸。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750040107
					],
					"speakerTitle": "蒂圖"
				},
				{
					"id": 750040107,
					"content": "據說以前也曾有過古遺蹟中的石碑：「任何人懷著不軌之心踏過此碑，我將用手化作龍爪扼住其人之脖頸。」",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750040108
					],
					"speakerTitle": "蒂圖"
				},
				{
					"id": 750040108,
					"content": "啊，那如果這塊石碑上寫著什麼警告或詛咒之類的…要怎麼辦啊…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750040109
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 750040109,
					"content": "看看就知道了…這是陶奧魯留下的，竟然，欸…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750040110,
						750040112
					],
					"speakerTitle": "蒂圖"
				},
				{
					"id": 750040110,
					"content": "好像有在哪裡聽過…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750040111
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 750040111,
					"content": "之前蒂圖有講過在深淵侵蝕納塔的時候，帶領部族裡的人和深淵…還有兩位坎瑞亞士兵交戰的人啦。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750040113
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 750040113,
					"content": "呀！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750040114
					],
					"speakerTitle": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}"
				},
				{
					"id": 750040114,
					"content": "#哦哦，{F#妳}{M#你}們記得很清楚嘛。講故事的人大多數的時候都很喜歡這種能夠記住故事的人哦。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750040115
					],
					"speakerTitle": "蒂圖"
				},
				{
					"id": 750040115,
					"content": "畢竟要成為講故事的人…記住故事也是最基本的素養。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750040116
					],
					"speakerTitle": "蒂圖"
				},
				{
					"id": 750040116,
					"content": "我看看…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750040117
					],
					"speakerTitle": "蒂圖"
				},
				{
					"id": 750040117,
					"content": "上面寫著異邦的朋友…「西弗安雅與伊利薩」…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750040118
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 750040118,
					"content": "嗯…「你們更希望自己在故事裡是懦夫、暴徒或懸掛的釘刺，就像咬龍的蜜蟲那樣讓部族的人們不敢懈怠，世代警惕。」",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750040119
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 750040119,
					"content": "嗯…「但我要在這裡說出真相，因為你們永遠是與部族共進退的豪傑，永遠是回聲之子的兄弟。」",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750040120
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 750040120,
					"content": "啊，原來那兩個坎瑞亞人還和部族一起戰鬥過？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750040121
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 750040121,
					"content": "這是…那兩位坎瑞亞士兵的名字，在、在所有的故事裡他們都是邪惡的化身，我甚至在噩夢中也有看過他們的身影。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750040122
					],
					"speakerTitle": "蒂圖"
				},
				{
					"id": 750040122,
					"content": "「再不停止哭泣，坎瑞亞士兵的亡靈就將循聲找到你的影子」…結果其實都是假的，是一場騙局？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750040123
					],
					"speakerTitle": "蒂圖"
				},
				{
					"id": 750040123,
					"content": "可是這對他們不公平…憑什麼為部族付出那麼大犧牲的人，卻要背負那麼久的罵名。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750040124
					],
					"speakerTitle": "蒂圖"
				},
				{
					"id": 750040124,
					"content": "對啊，那也太可憐了吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750040125
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 750040125,
					"content": "嗚…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750040126
					],
					"speakerTitle": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}"
				},
				{
					"id": 750040126,
					"content": "他們並不在乎是否得享美譽…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750040127
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 750040127,
					"content": "他們只在乎意志是否能實現。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750040128
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 750040128,
					"content": "是這樣嗎…啊，我、我懂了！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750040129
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 750040129,
					"content": "就像大部分的英雄並不是為了得到讚揚，才去做那些讓他們成為英雄的事。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750040130
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 750040130,
					"content": "他們是去「做了那些事」，才成為了英雄，所以才不在乎別人怎麼評價他們吧…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750040131
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 750040131,
					"content": "……",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750040132
					],
					"speakerTitle": "蒂圖"
				},
				{
					"id": 750040132,
					"content": "唉…也許真的是這樣，可是…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750040133
					],
					"speakerTitle": "蒂圖"
				},
				{
					"id": 750040133,
					"content": "啊，「鐫光銘印」繼續往前飛了！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750040134
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 750040134,
					"content": "#哇，這裡就是…就是他們最終封印了深淵的地方，看，{NICKNAME}，那個中間，有好多金色的花紋…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750040135
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 750040135,
					"content": "也有洩露出深淵的痕跡。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750040136
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 750040136,
					"content": "看來就是那個在吸引「鐫光銘印」，無論如何我們都要到那裡看看才可以…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "蒂圖"
				},
				{
					"id": 750040112,
					"content": "啊，是抵抗深淵的長老…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750040113
					]
				}
