				{
					"id": 750040203,
					"content": "嗚…嗚…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750040204
					],
					"speakerTitle": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}"
				},
				{
					"id": 750040204,
					"content": "那個聲音更加完整了，但是…不知道為什麼感覺並沒有之前那麼害怕。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750040205
					],
					"speakerTitle": "蒂圖"
				},
				{
					"id": 750040205,
					"content": "只不過頭還是有點痛。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750040206
					],
					"speakerTitle": "蒂圖"
				},
				{
					"id": 750040206,
					"content": "#{NICKNAME}呢，有什麼感覺嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750040207,
						750040209
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 750040207,
					"content": "沒什麼大礙…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750040208
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 750040208,
					"content": "那就好那就好。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750040211
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 750040211,
					"content": "#那{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}，有沒有覺得不舒服啊？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750040212
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 750040212,
					"content": "嗯？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750040213
					],
					"speakerTitle": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}"
				},
				{
					"id": 750040213,
					"content": "目前看來好像也沒什麼事…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750040214
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 750040214,
					"content": "到了這裡就可以很明顯感覺到聲音是從石柱上來的…那應該是…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750040215
					],
					"speakerTitle": "蒂圖"
				},
				{
					"id": 750040215,
					"content": "一起被封印的坎瑞亞士兵…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750040216
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 750040216,
					"content": "嗚…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750040217
					],
					"speakerTitle": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}"
				},
				{
					"id": 750040217,
					"content": "也就是說…他們的意識也和深淵一起被封印了那麼多年…可是這裡到底出了什麼問題呀？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750040218
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 750040218,
					"content": "其實…這裡的問題和上面的「小縫影針」很像，深淵湧動讓「鐫光銘印」的力量破碎，並且被擠出大的封印之柱外…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750040219
					],
					"speakerTitle": "蒂圖"
				},
				{
					"id": 750040219,
					"content": "所以我們需要找到這裡的大「鐫光銘印」碎片，然後想辦法把「蛋殼」重新拼起來。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750040220
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 750040220,
					"content": "對，這樣封印就能夠恢復完整，深淵也可以持續被封印在此，然後…一切大概就會恢復原樣了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750040221
					],
					"speakerTitle": "蒂圖"
				},
				{
					"id": 750040221,
					"content": "不過就和之前在「小縫影針」那裡一樣，固態燃素建構的地面和深淵會有劇烈的衝突反應，這也是地面起伏不定的原因…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750040222
					],
					"speakerTitle": "蒂圖"
				},
				{
					"id": 750040222,
					"content": "這點請一定要小心哦。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750040223
					],
					"speakerTitle": "蒂圖"
				},
				{
					"id": 750040223,
					"content": "不過，大「鐫光銘印」碎片啊…到底應該怎麼找呀…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750040224
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 750040224,
					"content": "呀…呀！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750040225
					],
					"speakerTitle": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}"
				},
				{
					"id": 750040225,
					"content": "#什麼，有銘印的力量藏在那個裡面嗎？{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}的鼻子很靈哦…呃…你用的是鼻子嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750040226
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 750040226,
					"content": "不過之前有這塊石頭嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750040227
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 750040227,
					"content": "#剛才{NICKNAME}靠近大「鐫光銘印」的時候…好像是那時候出現的？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750040228
					],
					"speakerTitle": "蒂圖"
				},
				{
					"id": 750040228,
					"content": "嗯？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750040229
					],
					"speakerTitle": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}"
				},
				{
					"id": 750040229,
					"content": "好啦，總之，我們先到那塊石塊周圍看看！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 750040209,
					"content": "感覺聲音滿立體的。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750040210
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 750040210,
					"content": "#誰問{F#妳}{M#你}這個啦！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750040211
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				}
			]
