						750040304
					],
					"speakerTitle": "蒂圖"
				},
				{
					"id": 750040304,
					"content": "快，快把我們一起封印進去——就像說好的那樣——",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750040305
					],
					"speakerTitle": "？？？"
				},
				{
					"id": 750040305,
					"content": "嘶—然後離開，離開——你們為什麼還不離開——災厄——",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750040306
					],
					"speakerTitle": "？？？"
				},
				{
					"id": 750040306,
					"content": "仔細聽，不只有…那下面不只有兩位士兵說話的聲音。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750040307
					],
					"speakerTitle": "蒂圖"
				},
				{
					"id": 750040307,
					"content": "#從那道發光紋路的背後，從比那痛苦的嘶吼更為遙遠之處…\\n{F#妳}{M#你}聽到有人在怒吼，{F#妳}{M#你}聽到有龍在忍痛低吟。\\n{F#妳}{M#你}聽到血肉交融在一起的聲音，和言語無法形容的黏膩巨物緩緩向前行進的腳步。\\n但{F#妳}{M#你}也聽到彷彿有千萬隻手…千萬隻手在不斷抗拒，在向外推…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NEED_CLICK_BLACK_SCREEN",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750040308
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 750040308,
					"content": "#{F#妳}{M#你}聽到…{F#妳}{M#你}聽到…{F#妳}{M#你}聽到…在狹小的黑暗裡，那是一場永遠無法停息的戰鬥。\\n那是一場…持續到永恆終結之時的折磨。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NEED_CLICK_BLACK_SCREEN",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750040309,
						750040310
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 750040309,
					"content": "他們無法獲得安息…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750040311
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 750040311,
					"content": "嗚！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750040312
					],
					"speakerTitle": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}"
				},
				{
					"id": 750040312,
					"content": "那些英雄們…他們直到今日也在不停地戰鬥…為了不讓深淵從「鐫光銘印」之後湧出。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750040313
					],
					"speakerTitle": "蒂圖"
				},
				{
					"id": 750040313,
					"content": "我敘說那些故事是有意義的，我們一直銘記著這些勇士的犧牲，不忘記他們所有的付出。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750040314
					],
					"speakerTitle": "蒂圖"
				},
				{
					"id": 750040314,
					"content": "可是…可是這份痛苦太沉重了。這跟故事不一樣，故事裡我們說：「英雄們受了傷，抖了抖身體，就跟沒事一樣站了起來。」",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750040315
					],
					"speakerTitle": "蒂圖"
				},
				{
					"id": 750040315,
					"content": "但是真正的受傷、真正的折磨不是那樣輕鬆的東西…他們一直在承受如此巨大的痛苦。在那狹小無光的世界，承受了那麼多年。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750040316
					],
					"speakerTitle": "蒂圖"
				},
				{
					"id": 750040316,
					"content": "嗚！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750040317
					],
					"speakerTitle": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}"
				},
				{
					"id": 750040317,
					"content": "怎麼會這樣，我們就沒辦法做點什麼嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750040318
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 750040318,
					"content": "我…我也想為他們做點什麼，可是…那可是深淵…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750040319
					],
					"speakerTitle": "蒂圖"
				},
				{
					"id": 750040319,
					"content": "也許唯一能做的就是繼承他們的意志，重新將「鐫光銘印」封起來…在部族的故事裡，「縫影針」並不是第一次掉落。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750040320
					],
					"speakerTitle": "蒂圖"
				},
				{
					"id": 750040320,
					"content": "從前一定也有人來到這裡，從前也有人…看過陶奧魯的碑文。那些修復「鐫光銘印」的人，一定也看到了我們看到的那些。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750040321
					],
					"speakerTitle": "蒂圖"
				},
				{
					"id": 750040321,
					"content": "但是…部族裡的故事沒有更改過，因為故事裡的警告是真實的警告，危險也是真實的危險。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750040322
					],
					"speakerTitle": "蒂圖"
				},
				{
					"id": 750040322,
					"content": "我們只能把「鐫光銘印」修好然後離開，我們只能…銘記一切，不遺忘在這裡看到的任何事…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750040323
					],
					"speakerTitle": "蒂圖"
				},
				{
					"id": 750040323,
					"content": "可是…嗚…可是他們明明是英雄，卻要一直在這裡受折磨…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750040324
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 750040324,
					"content": "派蒙說得對。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750040325
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 750040325,
					"content": "英雄不該落得這樣的結局。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750040326
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 750040326,
					"content": "我知道，我也想讓那些仍然受苦的戰士們得到安息，可是…我沒有那樣的力量，我、我只是個敘事人…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750040327
					],
					"speakerTitle": "蒂圖"
				},
				{
					"id": 750040327,
					"content": "#{NICKNAME}…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750040328
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 750040328,
					"content": "唔！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750040329,
						750040330
					],
					"speakerTitle": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}"
				},
				{
					"id": 750040329,
					"content": "沒關係，我們有力量。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750040331
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 750040331,
					"content": "#…{NICKNAME}，真的嗎？{F#妳}{M#你}們真的願意幫忙？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750040332
					],
					"speakerTitle": "蒂圖"
				},
				{
					"id": 750040332,
					"content": "#嗯，我就知道{NICKNAME}一定會願意出手。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750040333
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 750040333,
					"content": "呀！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750040334
					],
					"speakerTitle": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}"
				},
				{
					"id": 750040334,
					"content": "#深淵是很危險的…不過，我這樣說並不是質疑{NICKNAME}的實力，只是…不希望{F#妳}{M#你}們勉強自己。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750040335
					],
					"speakerTitle": "蒂圖"
				},
				{
					"id": 750040335,
					"content": "沒關係，對付深淵我們可謂是經驗豐富啦。而且，不是還有那個「鐫光銘印」在嘛。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750040336
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 750040336,
					"content": "嗯…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750040337
					],
					"speakerTitle": "蒂圖"
				},
				{
					"id": 750040337,
					"content": "#唉…{F#妳}{M#你}們比我想像的還要了不起。{F#妳}{M#你}們願意為解決他人的痛苦而付出自己的力量，真的，真的是很了不起的英雄。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750040338
					],
					"speakerTitle": "蒂圖"
				},
				{
					"id": 750040338,
					"content": "#對，我是敘事人…我要記錄下英雄的故事。異邦而來的英雄{NICKNAME}啊，請務必…請務必讓我看看{F#妳}{M#你}們戰勝深淵的英姿吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750040339
					],
					"speakerTitle": "蒂圖"
				},
				{
					"id": 750040339,
					"content": "嗯，一定會贏的！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750040340
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 750040340,
					"content": "那麼…要現在解開「鐫光銘印」嗎？還是…再做一些準備？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750040341,
						750040343
					],
					"speakerTitle": "蒂圖"
				},
				{
					"id": 750040341,
					"content": "現在就解開吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750040342
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 750040342,
					"content": "#好的，{NICKNAME}，祝{F#妳}{M#你}…不，是希望{F#妳}{M#你}能夠成功！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "蒂圖"
				},
				{
					"id": 750040343,
					"content": "稍等，再做些準備。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750040344
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 750040344,
					"content": "#好的，盡量做點準備吧…小心一點，{NICKNAME}。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "蒂圖"
				},
				{
					"id": 750040330,
					"content": "重新寫一下故事的結局吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750040331
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 750040310,
					"content": "他們仍然在戰鬥…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750040311
					]
				}
			]
		},
